ublic general-election polls are available, so the outlook rests on fundamentals.\n\nSwanson has run an active campaign, debating Stauber on mining, affordability and health care, and outside groups have spent more opposing Stauber than supporting him. A national environment favorable to Democrats gives her a path, but the district's lean, the incumbent's resources and the absence of polling evidence of a close race keep Stauber clearly favored.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0911, "margin": -8.65}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.1026, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1108, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.1084, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1049, "margin": -8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0871, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0901, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.107, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0757, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0829, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.082, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1056, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1215, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0741, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0844, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0764, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0943, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0865, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.083, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0838, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0792, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0882, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.0721, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.0775, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.0877, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.0843, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.0575, "margin": -10